<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_10__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "In the case of an industrial design generated by computer in circumstances such that there is no human author, the person by whom the arrangements necessary for the creation of the industrial design are made shall be taken to be the author."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
