<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A divisional application shaJl be entitled to the priority date of the initial application."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
