<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where an application for the registration of an industrial design has been accorded a filing date and the application is not withdrawn, the Registrar shall cause the application to be examined to determine whether it complies with the formal requirements."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
