<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Registrar shall not refuse to register an industrial design under subsection (3) until the applicant has been given an opportunity to be heard."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
