<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_24__subsec_1__para_b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_24__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "the Court may in any proceeding under this section decide any question that may be necessary or expedient to decide in connection with the rectification of the Register;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_24__subsec_1__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_III__cl_24__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
