<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this Act, there shall be established an Industrial Designs Registration Office which shall be the office of the Registrar."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
