<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Registrar is satisfied that the failure to extend the registration was due to an accident or mistake, he may publish in the Gaiette a notice of intention to restore the lapsed registration."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
