<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any interested person may, within three months from the date of such publication, give notice to the Registrar of opposition to the restoration of the registration and shall serve a copy of the notice on the applicant for restoration."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
