<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Actions or proceedings shall not be taken in respect of an infringement of the registered industrial design committed between the date on which the registration of the industrial design ceased to be in force and the date of the publication in the Gazette of the restoration of the industrial design."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
