<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_IX__cl_45__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where by this Act or any regulations made under this Act any act has to be done by or to any person in connection with an industrial design or any procedure relating thereto, the act may, under and in accordance with this Act and any regulations made under this Act or in particular cases by special leave of the Registrar, be done by or to an agent of that person duly authorised in the prescribed manner."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
