<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_IX__cl_48__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Minister, by order, declares that an application for protection in respect of an industrial design is, in accordance with the law of a convention country, equivalent to an application made in that convention country, the first-mentioned application shall, for the purposes of this Act, be deemed to have been made in that convention country."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
