<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_IX__cl_50__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_IX__cl_50__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A certificate of registration granted under the Registered Designs Act 1949 of the United Kingdom shall have the maximum period of validity accorded under the repealed laws and for this purpose, the extension procedure shall be as prescribed in the regulations made under section 47 of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
