<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires— \"article\" means any article of manufacture or handicraft, and includes any part of such article or handicraft if that part is made and sold separately; \"author\" means the person who creates a design; \"corwention country\" means a country in respect of which there is in force for the time being an order under section 48 declaring it to be a corwention country for the purposes of this Act; \"Court\" means the High Court or a judge thereof; \"industrial design\" means features of shape, configuration, pattern or ornament applied to an article by any industrial process or means, being features which in the finished article appeal to and are judged by the eye, but does not include—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
