<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_36__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "produces or tenders or causes to be produced or tendered in evidence any document mentioned in paragraph (b) or (c) knowing such document or any entry therein to be false; or"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
