<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_36__para_e> <https://schema.org/text> "falsely makes a claim that he is the owner of the registered industrial design or represents that he is acting in the capacity of, or on behalf of the owher of the registered industrial design, shall be guilty of an offence and is liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding fifteen thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
