<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where an offence under this Act committed by a body corporate is proved to have been committed with the consent or connivance of, or to be attributable to any neglect on the part of a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate, or any person who was purporting to act in any such capacity, he, as well as the body corporate, shall be guilty of that offence and shall be liable to be prosecuted against and punished accordingly as provided by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the affairs of a body corporate are managed by its members, subsection (1) shall apply in relation to the acts and defaults of a member in connection with his functions of management as if he were a director of the body corporate."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
