<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VI__cl_32__subsec_2__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "sells, or offers or keeps for sale, or hires, or offers or keeps for hire, any of the articles described in paragraph (a) and (b)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
