<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VI__cl_32__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection (1), the right of the owner of a registered industrial design shall not extend to acts in respect of an article to which the registered industrial design is applied by or with the consent of the owner after the article has been lawfully imported into or sold in Malaysia."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
