<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VI__cl_34> <https://schema.org/name> "Any ground on which the registration of an industrial"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_VI__cl_34> <https://schema.org/text> "design may be revoked is available as a defence in an action for infringement of a registered industrial design."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
