<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_V__cl_29__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The rights of an owner with respect to a registered industrial design are personal property and are capable of assignment and transmission by operation of law."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_V__cl_29__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@/~part_V__cl_29> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/31/eng@> .
